      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. regarding those \"cultural norms and behaviors\" you mentioned for zone 3... when you suggest modeling things like social distancing adherence or mask-wearing in those specific South Asian and East African groups, are you implying there's a cultural tendency toward less compliance or different hygiene standards in those communities compared to the white populations in zones 1 and 4? i'm trying to see if the simulation needs to assign higher transmission coefficients to those specific ethnic groups because of how they interact socially.",
